<title>USA: Texas BOR, won by First Southwest.</title>
<headline>Texas BOR, won by First Southwest.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Southwest Co. said it won $11.120 million of Texas Board of Regents, Lamar University, combined fee and revenue system refunding bonds, Series 1997, with a true interest cost of 5.17 percent.</p>
